Idea: we still have a bunch of repeated code here. Could/Should we create a macro for some of these?

I think the following code doesn't work but it hopefully gets the idea across.
```
#define SHORTCUT_ACTION_CASE(actionName, actionArgName, actionArgVal)
case ShortcutAction::actionName##actionArgVal:
{
  actionName##"Args" {};
  args.##actionArgName(##actionArgVal);
  ActionEventArgs eventArgs { args };
  ##_##actionName##"Handlers(*this, eventArgs);
  return eventArgs.Handled();
}
```
